WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.555
Every day, customers walk into your shop with files on their phones.

2
00:00:04.805 --> 00:00:08.183
They send them on WhatsApp, on Bluetooth, on pen drives.

3
00:00:08.433 --> 00:00:11.449
And you stop everything to print them, one by one.

4
00:00:12.199 --> 00:00:13.658
Meet DocuFast.

5
00:00:13.908 --> 00:00:18.460
A QR code on your counter that turns your shop into a self-serve print point.

6
00:00:19.210 --> 00:00:23.165
Your customer scans the code and uploads a file from their phone.

7
00:00:23.415 --> 00:00:28.308
They choose copies, colour and sides, and see the exact price before they pay.

8
00:00:29.058 --> 00:00:33.119
They pay by UPI. No cash, no change, no arguments.

9
00:00:33.869 --> 00:00:38.677
The moment payment is confirmed, the file prints automatically on your own printer.

10
00:00:39.427 --> 00:00:43.830
Your live board shows every order, and a sound tells you when a new one arrives.

11
00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:46.904
If a print fails, you retry it with one tap.

12
00:00:47.654 --> 00:00:54.211
Customers give consent before uploading. Their files are stored privately and deleted after printing.

13
00:00:54.961 --> 00:01:00.815
You set your own prices, see today's orders and money collected, and export reports to Excel.

14
00:01:01.565 --> 00:01:05.050
Try DocuFast free. We will set it up with you on a call.

15
00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:09.468
Start your free trial at software.docufastindia.com
